{"createdAt":"2026-08-01T18:29:53.028Z","offset":7083,"path":"/devices/m5sticks3","providerType":"response.output_audio_transcript.done","raw":"{\"type\":\"response.output_audio_transcript.done\",\"event_id\":\"d677b7d7-c9a9-469e-8446-857ba8395fe0\",\"item_id\":\"cfc2e4cf-99f4-479a-9a22-3e9d80e0a54a\",\"transcript\":\"Once upon a time in a quiet village nestled between misty hills, a young girl named Lila discovered an old wooden box buried beneath her grandmother's garden. Inside, she found a glowing map that whispered secrets of hidden treasures and forgotten lands. Excited and curious, Lila set off on an adventure, crossing sparkling rivers and climbing towering trees, meeting talking animals who guided her way. She faced a fierce storm that tested her courage, but with the map's light, she found shelter in a cave filled with ancient carvings telling stories of brave heroes. Emerging stronger, Lila reached a golden meadow where the treasure awaited—not gold or jewels, but a magical seed that could bring endless spring to her village. As she planted it, flowers bloomed everywhere, and the villagers celebrated her bravery. Lila learned that true treasure lies in courage and kindness, living happily ever after in her enchanted home. The village thrived with laughter and color, and Lila grew into a wise storyteller, sharing her tale with every generation to come.\",\"response_id\":\"07a7e4b8-6d0c-493b-9754-cb783880a95d\",\"content_index\":0,\"output_index\":0,\"previous_item_id\":null}","receivedAtMs":1785608993009,"sequence":51,"sessionId":"prj_bd8785e119fe4f1d8631bb95e1dea748:m5sticks3:a24028cb-b3dd-4e47-8f17-e1a8c5da22f5","type":"events.iterate.com/kit/provider-event"}
